  "title": "BBQ Chicken Wings",
  "description": "This yummy honey barbeque sauce is great on chicken wings, pork or short ribs. The soy sauce and oyster sauce hint at an Asian inspiration, while the gin gives it an undeterminable edge.",
  "authors": [
    "Patrick"
  ],
